Package: crabwalld
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nftables
Description: per-app firewall daemon for Linux
 crabwalld watches outbound connections and enforces per-application
 firewall rules via nftables (with NFQUEUE first-packet hold when
 available). It prompts through the crabwall TUI for unknown traffic.

Package: crabwall
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: per-app firewall TUI and CLI for Linux
 Live connection feed, one-key allow/deny prompts, rule and log
 management for the crabwalld daemon.
